sequenceDiagram
    autonumber 13
    actor Student
    participant Browser as Test UI (Next.js)
    participant API as API Routes (/api/*)
    participant Controller as Controllers (MVC)
    participant Service as Domain Services
    participant DB as MongoDB (Mongoose)

    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
        note over Student, DB: Phase 3: Test Submission, Result Persistence & Scoring
        Student->>Browser: Clicks "Submit Test"
        activate Browser
        Browser->>Browser: Evaluates answers & computes raw score
        Browser->>API: POST /api/results (testId, answers, score, breakdown)
        activate API

        API->>Controller: resultController.createResult(req)
        activate Controller
        Controller->>Controller: getServerSession(authOptions) - verify student session

        Controller->>Service: resultService.createResult(userId, data)
        activate Service
        Service->>DB: Result.create({ userId, testId, answers, score, ... })
        activate DB
        DB-->>Service: Saved Result Document
        deactivate DB

        Service->>DB: User.findById(userId)
        activate DB
        DB-->>Service: User Document
        deactivate DB

        Service->>Service: Update testsTaken, highestScore, lastTestDate, wrongQuestions
        Service->>DB: user.save()
        activate DB
        DB-->>Service: User record updated
        deactivate DB

        Service-->>Controller: Return newResult
        deactivate Service

        Controller-->>API: 201 Created ({ result: newResult })
        deactivate Controller

        API-->>Browser: 201 Created JSON
        deactivate API

        Browser-->>Student: Displays Test Summary (SAT Score, Section Breakdown, Review CTA)
        deactivate Browser
    end
